DTSTART:20260610T090000
DTEND:20260610T163000
SUMMARY:Cast3M Training on PASAPAS and user procedures
DESCRIPTION:This training course is free and will be given in English by videoconference . This training course is intended for advanced users. The objective of this training is to explain how the PASAPAS procedure works. The algorithm for solving non-linear quasi-static problems is explained in detail as well as how to modify it when necessary. For CEA staff\, in addition to this form\, please register with yo\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16075/
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16075/
END:VEVENT
