SUMMARY:Constructing Singular 3-Manifolds from Expanding Thurston Maps
DESCRIPTION:The class of expanding Thurston maps on S² possesses rich combinatorial structure. Using these maps as a template\, we construct a new dynamical system by taking the metric quotient under the identifications induced by the dynamics: a singular 3-manifold with a small set of singularities equipped with a homeomorphism. We also establish a necessary condition ensuring that the resulting singular 3-ma\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16767/
LOCATION:IHP\, 11 rue Pierre et Marie Curie\, Paris 5e
URL:https://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16767/
