SUMMARY:Quasilinear NLS models with intensity-dependent dispersion
DESCRIPTION:I will overview models given by the quasilinear Schrodinger equation with the intensity-dependent dispersion coefficient: well-posedness\, smoothness of solitary waves\, and the nonlinear stability of the periodic waves. The unique focus is to derive a sharp criterion for the energetic stability of the smooth periodic waves by using the period function and the dynamical system methods.\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/15969/
